        title: "Chronology of <span>Terrorism</span> in Peru (1980 — 2026)",
        subhead: "Timeline of attacks, massacres, and clashes linked to Shining Path and the Militarized Communist Party of Peru (MPCP) in Ayacucho, Junin, Huancavelica, Cusco, and the VRAEM region.",
